"expect: rule-8"
":doc is mandatory on every exported defun (AGENT_SPEC_CORE 9, rule 8)."
"Only a checker can see this: the grammar makes :doc optional because it is"
"optional for private functions, and export status is not a syntactic property."
(module m
  :doc "Module carrying an undocumented export."
  :export [visible])

(defun visible [(x Int64)] -> Int64
  (+ x 1))
